{"id":10656,"date":"2026-06-09T12:30:05","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T12:30:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10656"},"modified":"2026-06-09T12:30:05","modified_gmt":"2026-06-09T12:30:05","slug":"mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/","title":{"rendered":"Mice Control in Melbourne: How Long Does It Take to Fully Get Rid of a Mice Problem?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You heard it at 2am.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That scratching sound coming from inside the wall. Maybe behind the kitchen cupboards. Maybe under the floorboards. You told yourself it was probably nothing. But then you found the droppings near the pantry, and that was that.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If this sounds like your week, you are not alone. Mice problems are surprisingly common in Melbourne homes, particularly during the cooler months when rodents start looking for warmth indoors. And once they are in, they do not leave on their own.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The question most Melbourne homeowners ask first is a reasonable one. How long is this actually going to take to sort out?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The honest answer is that it depends on a few things. But we will walk you through exactly what to expect.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Why Mice Move Into Melbourne Homes\u00a0<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10657\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.28-PM-240x300.jpeg\" alt=\"rat control in melbourne\" width=\"1003\" height=\"1254\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.28-PM-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.28-PM-819x1024.jpeg 819w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.28-PM-768x960.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.28-PM.jpeg 1122w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1003px) 100vw, 1003px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before getting into timelines, it helps to understand why mice are in your home in the first place.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Melbourne&#8217;s weather plays a big role. As temperatures drop through autumn and winter, mice and rats start moving indoors looking for food and shelter. Older homes with gaps around pipes, cracks in the foundation, or loose roof tiles are especially easy for them to get into.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once a mouse finds a warm spot with access to food, it does not go looking for a better option. It stays. And because mice breed extremely fast, what starts as one or two can turn into a serious infestation within a matter of weeks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A single pair of mice can produce up to 60 offspring in a year. Each of those offspring can start breeding within about six weeks. So the longer you wait, the harder the job becomes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is why early action matters so much when it comes to mice control in Melbourne.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How Long Does It Actually Take<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is the part most people want a straight answer on. Here is what the timeline generally looks like.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a small infestation caught early, a professional treatment can begin to show results within a few days. Most of the mice activity will stop within one to two weeks after treatment is applied. This includes bait stations, traps, and any exclusion work done to seal entry points.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a moderate infestation where mice have been present for a few weeks, the timeline stretches out a bit. Expect two to three weeks before the problem is fully resolved. This is because there are more rodents to deal with, and treatment needs to reach all the areas where they are nesting and travelling.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a severe infestation, particularly in properties that have had an undetected problem for months, the process can take anywhere from three to six weeks. At this level, there are multiple nesting sites, established travel routes throughout the home, and sometimes damage to wiring and insulation that needs to be addressed separately.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In all cases, professional rodent control in Melbourne is always faster and more effective than trying to manage it yourself with hardware store traps and supermarket bait.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why DIY Usually Buys You Time But Does Not Fix the Problem<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Snap traps and bait from the hardware store can catch individual mice. And they do work to a point.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">But here is the issue. Mice are cautious animals. They quickly learn to avoid traps that have been placed in obvious spots. They also have a very strong sense of smell and can detect human scent on traps, which makes them wary.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">More importantly, DIY options do not deal with the cause of the infestation. They do not seal the entry points mice are using to get in. They do not find and treat the nesting sites. And they definitely do not deal with an established colony hiding inside your walls or roof cavity.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional mouse control in Melbourne addresses all of these things together, which is why it actually resolves the problem instead of just reducing it temporarily.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>What Professional Mice Control in Melbourne Involves\u00a0<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10659\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-168x300.jpeg\" alt=\"mice control in melbourne\" width=\"921\" height=\"1645\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you call a licensed pest controller for rodent control in Melbourne, here is what the process typically looks like.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The first step is a thorough inspection of the property. This covers the interior and exterior, including the roof void, subfloor, wall cavities, and any areas where mice are likely to be nesting or entering. A good technician will also look for the entry points, which are often much smaller than people expect. Mice can squeeze through a gap the size of a five cent coin.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After the inspection, a treatment plan is put together based on what was found. This usually involves a combination of bait stations placed in strategic locations, traps in high activity areas, and exclusion work to seal the entry points that were identified.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The bait used by professionals is far more effective than what you can buy over the counter. It is also handled and placed in a way that is safe for children and pets.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A follow-up visit is usually scheduled one to two weeks later to check the bait stations, remove any dead rodents, and assess whether further treatment is needed.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are dealing with a rat problem as well, <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\"><b>rat control in Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> follows a similar process but may involve larger bait stations and different placement strategies given that rats are more cautious and tend to travel along walls and fences rather than in open spaces.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Signs That the Treatment Is Working<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After professional mice control treatment has been applied, here is what to look out for in the following days.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mice activity will typically increase briefly in the first day or two as they encounter the bait and traps. This is normal. After that, you should notice scratching noises decreasing, fewer droppings appearing in new locations, and no fresh signs of gnawing or feeding.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By the end of the first week, most activity should be significantly reduced. By the two week mark, it should be very quiet or completely gone for a minor to moderate infestation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If activity is still noticeable after two weeks, that usually means there is a larger colony present or there are entry points that were not fully sealed on the first visit. A good pest controller will come back and reassess without extra hassle.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>How to Stop Them Coming Back\u00a0<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10658\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1-271x300.jpeg\" alt=\"mouse control in melbourne\" width=\"980\" height=\"1085\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1-271x300.jpeg 271w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1-925x1024.jpeg 925w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1-768x850.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1-1388x1536.jpeg 1388w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.36.27-PM-1.jpeg 1446w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 980px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Getting rid of the mice is one thing. Keeping them out is another.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A few simple habits make a big difference. Store food in sealed containers, especially grains, cereals, and pet food. Do not leave dirty dishes sitting out overnight. Keep bin lids closed properly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outside the home, clear away any woodpiles or debris sitting close to the walls. Trim back any shrubs or bushes that are touching the house, as these give mice a covered path to the walls. Make sure your compost bin has a solid base.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And book an annual inspection. Catching a new entry point before it becomes a problem is far cheaper and less stressful than dealing with a full infestation all over again.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><b>Get Help From a Local Team You Can Trust<\/b><\/h5>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you have got mice in your Melbourne home right now, the best thing you can do is call a professional sooner rather than later. The longer you wait, the bigger the job becomes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><b>7 States Pest Control,<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> we provide thorough and affordable <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\"><b>mice control in Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for both homes and businesses. Our licensed technicians carry out a full inspection, apply professional grade treatments, and make sure entry points are sealed so the problem does not come back.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We also handle rat control in Melbourne, mouse exterminator services, and full rodent control across the greater Melbourne area.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Call us on <\/span><a href=\"tel:+61434660060\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">+61 434 660 060<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> book your inspection today. Same day service is available.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get professional<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"> <b>pest control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> solutions for all types of infestations. From<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider control services<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to complete<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider removal service<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we ensure safe results. We also offer<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/fox-pest-control-in-melbourne\/\"> <b>fox population control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/possum-pest-control\/\"> <b>possum removal service Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Keep your home secure with<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and effective<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite treatment Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>You heard it at 2am. That scratching sound coming from inside the wall. Maybe behind the kitchen cupboards. Maybe under the floorboards. You told yourself it was probably nothing. But then you found the droppings near the pantry, and that was that. If this sounds like your week, you are not alone. Mice problems are [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10660,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10656","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Mice Control Melbourne: How Long Does It Take?<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Got a mice problem in Melbourne? Find out how long it takes to fully get rid of mice, what treatments work, and when to call a professional for rodent control.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mice Control Melbourne: How Long Does It Take?\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Got a mice problem in Melbourne? Find out how long it takes to fully get rid of mice, what treatments work, and when to call a professional for rodent control.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-06-09T12:30:05+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.35.58-PM-1.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"7 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#\/schema\/person\/d2eebd8e6e8b6f07170a10bc11d3dadb\"},\"headline\":\"Mice Control in Melbourne: How Long Does It Take to Fully Get Rid of a Mice Problem?\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-09T12:30:05+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\"},\"wordCount\":1344,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.35.58-PM-1.jpeg\",\"articleSection\":[\"Blog\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\",\"name\":\"Mice Control Melbourne: How Long Does It Take?\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.35.58-PM-1.jpeg\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-09T12:30:05+00:00\",\"description\":\"Got a mice problem in Melbourne? Find out how long it takes to fully get rid of mice, what treatments work, and when to call a professional for rodent control.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/mice-control-in-melbourne-how-long-does-it-take-to-fully-get-rid-of-a-mice-problem\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-06-09-at-4.35.58-PM-1.jpeg\",\"c